There are also clear differences between the two. In a traditional classroom, students and teachers meet face to face, while online learning takes place through a screen at home. Online study is more flexible, because you can view a recorded lesson again whenever you like. However, a real classroom offers warmer interaction with classmates. In my view, the two ways work best together.', '【15 分制】A 档(13-15):五要素齐全、组织有条理、语言准确多样;B 档(10-12):要点较全、少量错误;C 档(7-9):要点偏少、句型简单;D 档(0-6):内容不完整、错误多。', '["Online and traditional classroom learning share several common features.","Both ask students to study hard and to finish their tasks on time.","Online study is more flexible, while a real classroom offers warmer interaction.","In my view, the two ways work best together."]'::jsonb, '[{"wrong":"Both of them needs hard work.","correct":"Both of them need hard work.","note":"both 作主语谓语用复数 need。"},{"wrong":"Unlike with a classroom, online learning is flexible.","correct":"Unlike a traditional classroom, online learning is flexible.","note":"unlike 后直接接名词,不加 with。"},{"wrong":"Online learning is more flexible, but a classroom offers warmer interaction, while is fun.","correct":"Online learning is more flexible, while a classroom offers warmer interaction.","note":"while 表对比,连接两个对照分句,不重复连词。"}]'::jsonb, '【比较对照结构】
第1段(相同点):… share several common features. Both … Likewise, …
第2段(不同点):There are also clear differences. In a traditional classroom … , while online learning … However, … In my view, …', 2, 'required3', 'U4', 'sufe');

